  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Oily, Combo, Normal Skin</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Pores</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is:  </b>A two-in-one makeup remover and cleanser that thoroughly removes sunscreen and makeup while providing gentle exfoliation for soft, never stripped, skin.<br><br><b>Skin Type:</b> Normal, Combination, and Oily <br><br><b>Skincare Concerns:</b> Dullness and Pores<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This oil-free, bi-phase foaming cleanser combines the effectiveness of a makeup remover and cleanser in one step. It effortlessly removes sunscreen, face makeup, and oils, while PHA gently exfoliates for smoother, brighter-looking skin. <br><br><b>Clinical Results:</b> In a clinical test, immediately after first use: <br>- 100% agree it effectively cleanses my skin in just one wash <br>- 100% agree it drew out dirt, oil + impurities from skin</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><div style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; --context-coalesce-label-color: #000; --context-coalesce-label-font-weight: 600; width: 841.641px; position: relative; padding: 0px; color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-family: Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" ><div>-Shake well and apply two to four pumps onto dry or wet skin.&nbsp;<br>-Massage in circular motions for at least 30 seconds and rinse thoroughly with warm water.&nbsp;<br>-The formula is gentle enough for use in both the morning and at night.</div></div></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Water (Aqua/Eau), Jojoba Esters, Isononyl Isononanoate, Neopentyl Glycol Dicaprylate/Dicaprate, Decyl Glucoside, Glycerin, Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine, Sodium Methyl Cocoyl Taurate, Sodium Citrate, Betaine, Gluconolactone, Hydroxyacetophenone, Saccharide Isomerate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylyl Glycol, Sodium Lauroyl Oat Amino Acids, Citric Acid, Caramel, Xanthan Gum, Sclareolide, Tocopherol, Bacillus Ferment.</div></details>",
